        "paragraph": "As part of the DREAM project (Dynamic Calculation of Primary Materials by Automatic Metal Analysis), continuous analysis of the molten metal is carried out at the shaft smelting furnace. The project goal is to better exploit analysis tolerances and to avoid faulty batches.\nThe process optimisation department conducts targeted projects to optimise energy consumption, reduce the use of auxiliary and operating materials, and standardise process management (batch sequence, salt utilisation, etc.). Further information about energy efficiency is presented in the *Energy* and emissions section.\nEXPANSION OF SORTING FACILITIES CAPACITY: In order to make even better use of the growing supply of mixed scrap in the future, AMAG is further expanding its recycling capacities and expertise in the scrap sorting area. This makes a significant contribution to securing supplies of aluminium scrap.",
