        ],
        "paragraph": "1&1 is aware of its responsibility for people and the environment and assumes social responsibility. This awareness shapes the Company's approach to both its own business activities and those in its supply chain. As a means of building reliable and long-term relationships that include the joint assumption of responsibility, the 1&1 Group involves its business partners in the commitment to compliance with human rights and environmental due diligence obligations and requires this commitment as the foundation of any cooperation.\n1&1 offers to its customers a comprehensive portfolio of individually tailored mobile voice and data services and products as well as landline connections (broadband).\n1&1 considers the examination of the impact of activities on the environment and society in all links of the added-value chain to be its task, and part of this task is the assumption of responsibility for the supply chain.",
