        "paragraph": "There have been no material changes in the DBG risk profile compared to the previous year. The reduction of the required economic capital is partly due to a revision of scenarios at Clearstream Securities Services (€-81 million) and for non-banks. Including Crypto Finance in full caused credit risk to increase by €27 million and market price risk by €10 million. Methodological changes resulted in an increase of €57 million in the pension risk.\nIn addition to the economic capital, which is measured by means of internal risk models, the normative perspective (regulatory capital requirements) is determined for the regulated companies.",
